<p>Three years of residency on a tight budget is hard. Before a college goes on your list, look up its tuition fees, hostel charges, stipend and bond or service conditions. Government and private colleges can be miles apart on fees, and bond terms depend on the state and the institution. Find all of this out beforehand. Learning about a heavy bond after you've been allotted the seat is too late.</p>

